title: A Foreign Ministry Line
subtitle: KO expected to own the voice abroad; the Left now has to use it.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and ministries_finalized = 1 and foreign_minister_party = "Lewica" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_foreign_ministry_line_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_foreign_ministry_line_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/cards/presidential-channel.webp

= A Foreign Ministry Line

KO considers the portfolio part of its natural inheritance and interprets
every independent initiative as amateurism. The ministry can build an eastern
European coalition, connect Warsaw to the continental left or state a
carefully bounded doctrine of its own.

- @eastern_coalition
- @continental_network
- @publish_doctrine

@eastern_coalition
title: Build an eastern coalition around Ukraine and enlargement
subtitle: Turn Polish geography into European leverage.
on-arrival: eu_influence += 4; eu_eastern_coalition += 5; ukraine_solidarity += 4; foreign_pressure -= 2; left_atlanticist_dissent += 1; ko_coalition_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Warsaw convenes an eastern coalition for Ukraine and European enlargement"

The ministry joins security, reconstruction and accession into one regional
position. KO cannot object to the direction, so it objects to the fact that
the Left announced it first.

- #poland_card_finish


@continental_network
title: Open a Warsaw-Berlin-Paris social channel
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Build influence below the summit photographs.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Sustained ministerial and party diplomacy requires one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; germany_relation += 3; france_relation += 3; eu_influence += 3; eu_left_network += 4; psl_coalition_dissent += 1; news_headline = "Warsaw opens a continental channel on work, energy and democratic security"

Ministers, unions and municipal leaders meet around industrial policy,
workers' rights and resilience. It is foreign policy conducted through
relationships that survive a single Council meeting.

- #poland_card_finish


@publish_doctrine
title: Publish a restrained, autonomous doctrine
subtitle: No resource or budget cost. Define the line without manufacturing a summit.
on-arrival: public_trust += 2; constitutional_restraint += 2; foreign_pressure -= 1; us_ambassador_channel += 1; government_coalition_dissent += 1; news_headline = "The Foreign Ministry publishes a doctrine of solidarity without blank cheques"

The text commits Poland to Ukraine, Europe and treaty allies while reserving
democratic scrutiny over escalation and arms policy. It is sober enough to be
ignored by television and precise enough to constrain the next crisis.

- #poland_card_finish
